  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/emp/202",
  "definition": "Appeal to and Hearing by Appeal Tribunal",
  "effectiveDate": "2009-08-17",
  "historyNote": "#2234, eff 1-1-83; amd by #2490, eff 10-1-83; ss by #2930, eff 12-21-84; amd by #3154, eff 12-2-85; ss by #5141, eff 5-6-91; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRES: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-05 New. #8469, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06 New. #8626-A eff 5-6-06; ss by #9526, eff 8-17-09",
